Package: ros-humble-int2dds-ffi-vendor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ros-humble-ros-workspace
Description: Vendor package that fetches the prebuilt int2DDS FFI library (shared library + C header) for the host platform and exposes it to the ROS 2 build as an imported CMake target.
 Used by rmw_int2dds_cpp.
